            "name": "🚧 Check whether a user has a specific permission. (BETA)",
            "description": {
              "content": "> 🚧 Under construction\n> **This endpoint is in beta.** Functionality may change without notice, support is limited, and use in production is not recommended. Your feedback is appreciated.\n\nReturns +{ \"granted\": true }+ if the permission is held by any of the\nuser's assigned roles; +{ \"granted\": false }+ otherwise. Never 404s on\nthe permission key itself — only on a missing user.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "users",
